  "description": "This skid steer pallet fork frame is constructed from heavy-duty grade 50 steel, ensuring exceptional durability and withstanding up to 4,000 pounds of pulling force. You can confidently lift and transport heavy objects with ease.\nFitment\nThis Pallet Fork Frame is designed to fit most skid steers, loaders, and tractors, including popular brands like New Holland, Bobcat Skid Steer, and Kubota. It features a universal skid steer style quick connect for easy attachment.\nFeatures\nQuality Steel Construction: Made from heavy-duty grade 50 steel, the YINTATECH skid steer pallet forks can withstand up to 4,000 pounds of pulling force, ensuring reliable and effortless handling of heavy objects.\nDouble Protection Finish: Our unique combination of powder coating and painted finish provides a robust and smooth surface, offering excellent resistance against rust and scratches, outperforming single-finish alternatives.\nQuick and Easy Installation: The quick attach pallet forks design allows for direct installation to your machine. The pallet fork blades can be freely moved and adjusted within a 17\" to 37\" range on the frame, enhancing flexibility and convenience.\nExtended Top Bracket: The extended top bracket reduces the risk of timber slipping during handling, providing additional safety and stability for your operations.\nExtensive Compatibility: Suitable for most loaders and tractors, including Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland, and Kubota. Ideal for a wide range of applications in farms, factories, warehouses, and construction sites. Note: Ships in 3 packages, may arrive separately",
